<title>USA: Union ratifies GM contract by wide margin.</title>
<headline>Union ratifies GM contract by wide margin.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union workers at General Motors Corp. ratified a new national labor contract with the automaker by the widest margin in more than a dozen years, the United Auto Workers said Monday.</p>
<p>The union said 85 percent of hourly and skilled workers voting approved the three-year pact, compared with 70.5 percent for the previous agreement in 1993.</p>
</text>
